    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/cf1275f8c99c218611acac78807efb08.poster.avif?t=1752038348\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/cf1275f8c99c218611acac78807efb08.webm?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/cf1275f8c99c218611acac78807efb08.mp4?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Relax in routines of everyday life and a part-time job hunting devils, in Baito Fight!!: Part-time Devil Hunter, a daily life sim JRPG for PC, Max, Linux, and the Playdate handheld console.<br>You play as Anansi, an ex-baseball player who's recently moved into a new apartment building, only to find that trouble has followed him there.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight devils in turn-based <strong>RPG</strong> combat with a <strong>realtime</strong> defensive batting mechanic!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to spend on convenience store runs, unlocking new powers, and paying off your overdue rent!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend friendly and quirky neighbors that live in and around your apartment building!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new day you play the game, the in-game world advances forward with you!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new side quests and story lines with branching paths, as your neighbor's lives move forward in time!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mystery behind the devil infestation in your neighborhood!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet the cat!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/9502a8fa1be25969251c1d799c3c6613.poster.avif?t=1752038348\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/9502a8fa1be25969251c1d799c3c6613.webm?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/9502a8fa1be25969251c1d799c3c6613.mp4?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/e29c4f36fa4adc1176ea92ace75283ef.poster.avif?t=1752038348\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/e29c4f36fa4adc1176ea92ace75283ef.webm?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/e29c4f36fa4adc1176ea92ace75283ef.mp4?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/929ef6cdb5b24f7ffd945d58f439dacc.poster.avif?t=1752038348\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/929ef6cdb5b24f7ffd945d58f439dacc.webm?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/929ef6cdb5b24f7ffd945d58f439dacc.mp4?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/cf1275f8c99c218611acac78807efb08.poster.avif?t=1752038348\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/cf1275f8c99c218611acac78807efb08.webm?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/cf1275f8c99c218611acac78807efb08.mp4?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Relax in routines of everyday life and a part-time job hunting devils, in Baito Fight!!: Part-time Devil Hunter, a daily life sim JRPG for PC, Max, Linux, and the Playdate handheld console.<br>You play as Anansi, an ex-baseball player who's recently moved into a new apartment building, only to find that trouble has followed him there.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight devils in turn-based <strong>RPG</strong> combat with a <strong>realtime</strong> defensive batting mechanic!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to spend on convenience store runs, unlocking new powers, and paying off your overdue rent!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend friendly and quirky neighbors that live in and around your apartment building!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new day you play the game, the in-game world advances forward with you!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new side quests and story lines with branching paths, as your neighbor's lives move forward in time!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mystery behind the devil infestation in your neighborhood!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet the cat!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/9502a8fa1be25969251c1d799c3c6613.poster.avif?t=1752038348\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/9502a8fa1be25969251c1d799c3c6613.webm?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/9502a8fa1be25969251c1d799c3c6613.mp4?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/e29c4f36fa4adc1176ea92ace75283ef.poster.avif?t=1752038348\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/e29c4f36fa4adc1176ea92ace75283ef.webm?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/e29c4f36fa4adc1176ea92ace75283ef.mp4?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/929ef6cdb5b24f7ffd945d58f439dacc.poster.avif?t=1752038348\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/929ef6cdb5b24f7ffd945d58f439dacc.webm?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852160/extras/929ef6cdb5b24f7ffd945d58f439dacc.mp4?t=1752038348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
